<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>VLC Streaming Server</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 40px; }
    .code { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; font-family: monospace; }
    .example { margin: 20px 0; }
    .endpoint { margin: 30px 0; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: 20px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>VLC Streaming Server</h1>
  <p>This server accepts a video URL and streams it back to you using VLC, and can generate M3U playlists from YouTube playlists.</p>

  <div class="endpoint">
    <h2>Video Streaming</h2>
    <p>Stream individual videos through VLC.</p>
    <div class="example">
      <strong>Endpoint:</strong> <code>GET /stream?video_url=&lt;URL&gt;</code>
    </div>

    <div class="example">
      <strong>Example:</strong>
      <div class="code">
        curl "http://localhost:<%= request.port %>/stream?video_url=https://example.com/video.mp4" --output video.ts
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="example">
      <strong>Or play directly with VLC:</strong>
      <div class="code">
        vlc "http://localhost:<%= request.port %>/stream?video_url=https://example.com/video.mp4"
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="endpoint">
    <h2>YouTube Playlist to M3U</h2>
    <p>Convert YouTube playlists to M3U format for streaming. Requires <code>YOUTUBE_API_KEY</code> environment variable.</p>
    <div class="example">
      <strong>Endpoint:</strong> <code>GET /playlist?playlist=&lt;PLAYLIST_ID_OR_URL&gt;</code>
    </div>

    <div class="example">
      <strong>Example with Playlist ID:</strong>
      <div class="code">
        curl "http://localhost:<%= request.port %>/playlist?playlist=PL6NdkXsPL07Il2hEQGcLI4dg_LTg7xA2L"
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="example">
      <strong>Example with YouTube URL:</strong>
      <div class="code">
        curl "http://localhost:<%= request.port %>/playlist?url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jfKfPfyJRdk&list=PL6NdkXsPL07Il2hEQGcLI4dg_LTg7xA2L"
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="example">
      <strong>Play M3U playlist with VLC:</strong>
      <div class="code">
        vlc "http://localhost:<%= request.port %>/playlist?playlist=PL6NdkXsPL07Il2hEQGcLI4dg_LTg7xA2L"
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Health Check</h2>
  <p><a href="/health">Check server status</a></p>

  <p><small>Active streams: <%= @active_streams %></small></p>
</body>
</html>
